Z||000000||Jncomutt||12-11-2001||10:20 AM||||   OK guys, I know a few of you here are totally anit rice any may laugh or say it deserves it or somethin like this, but someone stole my sisters CRX from her place of work this morning.  She works at ITT Hartford Insurance company in Southington.  While there aren't much of ya from CT here, this has really got me pissed off and well, you guys are always here..  Needless to say, its a Riced out crx.   Its 'boat paint' Green, it has those like 4 different color glitters in it.  Its lowered, stock rims, full custom interior, cell phone antenna, Huge Manchester Honda sticker on the back, and girlie girl racing stickers on the side.  Just hopin it will turn up somewhere, maybe someone in MA or RI, I dunno.. guess its a lost hope.  We all know how quickly these things will get stripped and left on the side of the road...<p>[This message has been edited by Jncomutt (edited 12-11-2001).]||||reg||1
