Z||000006||LoW_KeY||12-11-2001||03:03 PM||||Ouch, like it was said before no one derserves thier stuff stolen.. while I was working some one just decided to break in my car and choose my stereo system out of 15 other cars go figure.. new panasonic, sub, 10 cds, left my wallet in there that night to that was gone, along with the astrays.<P>I called the police but thats a joke the stuffs gone, I have a feeling the car will show up, lets just hope its ok.<P>-KC<P>------------------<BR>AIM: FierFormula88   <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/low_keysig.gif"> ||||reg||1
